  "details": "It would be cool if we can grant map makers to present more information about their worlds when someone is joining and is in the loading screens. We can engage players to know more about the map and see where they stand by providing persistent data.\n\nSee illustration explaining and with an example.\n\nThe loading screen I refer to is both the VRC's loading, and the world initializing screen. I know some people will automatically have the \"go\" option fire, so they'll miss it but some still want to manually hit go.\n\nIt could also support CSS/HTML just like VRC will be implementing in profiles and the quick menu for world developers in parallel with the new UI update?",
